<title>USA: Illinois River grain barge prices - Dec 13.</title>
<headline>Illinois River grain barge prices - Dec 13.</headline>
<text>
<p>Illinois River barge loading terminals bids to producers (dollar/bu)</p>
<p>				    South of Peoria	    change (cents/bu)</p>
<p>US 2 Yellow Corn		     2.71-2.74		unch</p>
<p>US 1 Yellow Soybeans		 7.12-7.15		up 2-3</p>
